/*!
@defgroup inputmux_driver INPUTMUX Connections
@details The MCUXpresso SDK provides device-specific INPUTMUX connection
identifiers for MCUXpresso SDK devices.

This component supplies the inputmux_index_t enumeration used by the generic
INPUTMUX driver. Each entry encodes a register/field tuple that selects the
trigger source for a target peripheral, including:
  - Frequency-measurement reference and target clock selectors per subsystem
    (AUDIO, CMPT, COMM, MAIN, MEDIA, SYSCON, WAKE)
  - Cross-bar (XBAR), DMA, and other inter-module trigger connections defined
    in the chip's INPUTMUX register map

*/
